<section id="method">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Method</div>
    <h2>I read the hidden scaffold.</h2>
    <div class="system-text-card">
      <strong>A system is a text.</strong>
      <p>A text is any system that organizes meaning, behavior, expectation, sequence, and omission. A SaaS flow, a form, a classroom, a video, an onboarding sequence, or a cultural scene can fail when it asks the human to continue without the missing scaffold.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="section-copy">My work comes from studying what happens when people face real systems without the protection of a script: language under pressure, institutions, forms, AI feedback, authentic material, social interpretation, and software boundaries.</p>
    <div class="method-note">That formation is not the product. It is the instrument.</div>
  </div>
</section>
